Licenses for the files in this directory
========================================

standard.css and images/
------------------------

The "Standard" widget theme of GWT (Google Web Toolkit) 2.8.2, Copyright
Google Inc., licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

standard.css is the stylesheet emitted by the GWT compiler for that theme;
images/ holds its four sprite sheets (corner.png, hborder.png, vborder.png,
splitPanelThumb.png), copied unmodified.

Modified: the url() references in standard.css are unchanged, and the file is
otherwise byte-identical to the compiler output.
